umi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5333333\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/szVAj3XrnMNbNs1WB9AUYRWjvdpHOZXVnDoVmriaJRpFEU3WOse92xunCFEkO2LI7kVoQibQCeu7LaM0U8AejFzA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">那么操作上，做长线的就放着别动了，不用规避这个小回调，防止因小失大，这个底部是毋庸置疑的。短线有利润的朋友可以先减仓，等回调颈线缩量后再把仓位补上。</strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\">但不管怎么样不能空仓，一定要有仓位在里面，行情启动的时候速度会非常快，我见过很多经历牛熊转换的老股民亏钱的原因，都是高位重仓操作，底部却轻仓不敢玩了，现在一定不能再犯这个错误了。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" align-items: center;display: flex;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;flex: 1 0 1px;letter-spacing: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" margin-top: 0.5em;margin-bottom: 0.5em; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(62, 62, 62);box-sizing: border-box;\"><svg style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;flex: 0 1 auto;box-shadow: rgb(0, 0, 0) 0px 0px 0px;line-height: 0;padding-right: 5px;padding-left: 5px;box-sizing: border-box;